ss_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"E4G-vk-ur7SdmOSHcum7aw","review_id":"sZhPmFe4I07vLK-9WAZvRQ","date":"2019-09-23T01:37:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9587104916572571,"text_excerpt":"French Truck Coffee is one of my favorite New Orleans finds so far! I had the iced New Orleans coffee, and it was good. I'm not obsessed with it, but it does get the job done, and I'd be interested in trying other drinks here. I also like how they offer dairy alternatives for milk! My favorite part about this place is the location. If you're here to study or work all day, it's right across from a cupcake shop and a poke place, so you have a few options for sustenance. The space itself is also really bright, not too loud, and has outlets and WiFi. Staff is also very friendly. Parking is residential if you don't want to pay for street parking, but it's not too difficult to find. Overall, it..."},{"business_id":"E4G-vk-ur7SdmOSHcum7aw","review_id":"On6uCOc8PmMLEtxrefH3hg","date":"2021-08-30T15:13:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9386816620826721,"text_excerpt":"French Truck really impressed us on our recent trip to New Orleans, and this hip location in the Garden District was perfect for an afternoon pick-me-up as we explored the neighborhood. She had a delicious New Orleans iced coffee, which was creamy, rich, and sweet, and I went with a classic macchiato, served elegantly with a side of mineral water. Usually, coffee shops don't really impress me, but French Truck, with its cool vibes and just really great coffee, definitely made a good and lasting impression. I look forward to definitely visiting again next time I am in the area."},{"business_id":"E4G-vk-ur7SdmOSHcum7aw","review_id":"rGsu5kfOvKpEIQYKUmSbug","date":"2019-07-14T15:27:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9378505945205688,"text_excerpt":"I love their coffee and the vibe. I used to come to this location when it was a CC's. Something about the way they renovated makes this French Truck location seem more inviting. Their iced lattes and baked goods are very good. I've only tried a couple things on the menu but the staff and service are wonderful. They're quick and always happy to help!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"E4G-vk-ur7SdmOSHcum7aw","photo_id":"wyxrIEHt7L_oDcuD74cKGg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/wyxrIEHt7L_oDcuD74cKGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9059458374977112},{"business_id":"E4G-vk-ur7SdmOSHcum7aw","photo_id":"inDymW4OOiwhCRlV7q0vYA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/inDymW4OOiwhCRlV7q0vYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9016653299331665},{"business_id":"E4G-vk-ur7SdmOSHcum7aw","photo_id":"1H8Zve4K2kyWlh8RaJeMuQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1H8Zve4K2kyWlh8RaJeMuQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8797849416732788},{"business_id":"E4G-vk-ur7SdmOSHcum7aw","photo_id":"s6SwNIo8C1CBUpjaCF6WgQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/s6SwNIo8C1CBUpjaCF6WgQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8708411455154419},{"business_id":"E4G-vk-ur7SdmOSHcum7aw","photo_id":"jHpJKTlfITz81zaz_MlDMQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jHpJKTlfITz81zaz_MlDMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.844875693321228}]},"notebook_case":null}
